OL,3,GNEWSADog waste bins in Hillingdon
OL,4,Ascrapped to save cash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll 700 dog waste bins in a west London
OL,7,Fborough are to be removed to save
OL,8,Fmoney, the local authority has said.
OL,10,FHillingdon Council said dog owners
OL,11,Fshould use litter bins or their own
OL,12,Fbins at home and a separate dog service
OL,13,Fwas no longer necessary.
OL,15,FThe change will save #160,000 a year,
OL,16,Fwith #60,000 of that to be spent on
OL,17,Fextra street cleaning.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
