OL,3,GNEWSADog waste bins in Hillingdon
OL,4,Ascrapped to save cash
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn its website, the Ruislip Residents'
OL,7,FAssociation said some of Hillingdon's
OL,8,Fdog bins already overflowed under the
OL,9,Fcurrent collection service, and that
OL,10,Fthe council had not published a list or
OL,11,Fmap to show any alternative bins.
